  "description": "The X-Night SL Disc is our top cyclocross bike, repeatedly ridden to victory by pro Belgian CX team Pauwels Sauzen-Bingoal. The versatile X-Night excels in fast, dry races as well as sand races where balance, finesse and fast cornering are crucial. It also shines on very muddy and hilly terrains where it lets you tap into every watt of power. Its specific geometry is uniquely designed for 60 minutes of acceleration, braking, cornering, hopping barriers and shouldering the bike thanks to its horizontal, flattened top tube. Due to the patented F-Steerer technology, all cables are integrated into the frame. This keeps the front of the frame mud-free, even in the worst conditions, so you can go an extra lap without having to change bikes.",
